mplate_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le08ob09re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le08ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le08ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Feng shui is an ancient Chinese system of balancing your physical environment to promote harmony and a sense of well-being. From a home's natural surroundings down to its furnishings and decor, feng shui's practitioners believe that everything has a certain energy, or \u201cchi,\u201d and how you arrange those objects can affect all aspects of our lives."}, {"time": "23000", "image": "engenn6le08ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "On a practical level, that means there's an optimal place for every object (bed, books, laptop, even garbage bins). The ideal position for your bed is diagonally opposite the door and against a solid wall with a view of the room and door. If you do not feel secured or grounded in your bedroom, changing your headboard to something more sturdy. A headboard is providing protection to your head as you sleep."}, {"time": "53000", "image": "engenn6le08ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "If you have side tables next to your bed, they should not have sharp edges and the tabletop should be lower than the top of your mattress. The sharp corners next to your head will keep you from total relaxation while sleeping."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Has a Nightmare"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "What is Feng Shui?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 8}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le08ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "furnishings"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the furniture and other things, such as curtains, in a room "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: According to feng shui, the furnishings have a certain energy."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when talking about objects in a bedroom."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "decor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the way that the inside of a room is decorated"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The decor in your bedroom should be soothing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "headboard"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the upright board at the end of a bed where your head is"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A headboard provide protection to your head as sleep."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "side table"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a table designed to be placed beside a bed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you have side tables next to your bed, they should not have sharp edges."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mattress"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the soft part of a bed that you lie on"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The tabletop should be lower than your mattress."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le08ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "What is Feng Shui?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Feng Shui (pronounced fung shway) is a Chinese system of organizing the furniture and other things in a house or building in a way that people believe will bring good luck and happiness."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Feng Shui states that chi (energy) lives in all things. This energy is made up of two opposite forces, yin (female) and yang (male). There are five elements in Feng Shui. There's fire, water, metal, earth and wood. A balance must always be present among the elements. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When positioning furniture and other objects in accordance with the principles of Feng Shui, you can use a compass or a bagua to place objects in the correct direction."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present and Present Continuous "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use Simple Present to talk about facts and healthy habits. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples:<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">Feng Shui promotes harmony and a sense of well-being.</span></li><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">Everything has a certain energy.</span></li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use Present Continuous to talk about temporary activities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">A headboard is providing protection to your head as you sleep.</span></li></ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do some research about Feng Shui. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of different ways to Feng Shui your bedroom."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at your list. Do you do any of them?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose 3-4 ways you could Feng Shui your room."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down why you chose them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Try one of them out."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I can talk about Feng Shui."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about different ways to Feng Shui my bedroom."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about my bedroom and objects in it."}]}]}